maya: awesome, @sam @jordan can one of you review a quick PR adding the ephemeral mint endpoint + client guard + the minimal retrieval example? I'll wire up the eval harness so it emits a csv of prompt, reference, model_output, tokens, latency.

sam: I can review. small checklist suggestion:
- add /api/mint-ephemeral that returns { key, expiresAt }
- client fetch wrapper that sets Authorization: Bearer <ephemeral>
- a README section "client-safe patterns" with a short snippet on retry limits and abort signals
- add one integration test that hits /api/embed with a mocked ephemeral key

lee: also add a devex note about not enabling long-running polls in getServerSideProps — that tripped a user last week. :memo:

maya: perfect. I'll open PR tonight and include the eval harness example. thanks all! :pray:
